          <label class="eyebrow text-[9px] block mb-2">Fabric</label><select id="fabricFilter" class="w-full border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--paper)] p-2 text-xs"><option value="all">All fabrics</option><option>Cotton</option><option>Lace</option><option>Modal</option><option>Microfibre</option><option>Swim knit</option><option>Satin</option></select>
          <button id="mobileFilterDone" class="lg:hidden solid-btn w-full mt-5 bg-[#292823] text-white py-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">View pieces</button>
        </aside>
        <div><div id="productGrid" class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-3 sm:gap-x-5 gap-y-8 sm:gap-y-10"></div><div id="emptyState" class="hidden py-20 text-center"><p class="serif text-2xl mb-2">Nothing found just yet</p><p class="text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">Try another search or adjust your filters.</p><button id="emptyClear" class="mt-5 border-b border-[#a7834f] text-xs pb-1">CLEAR FILTERS</button></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="story" class="bg-[#292823] text-[#f8f6f1] px-5 py-16 sm:py-24 text-center"><p class="eyebrow text-[#c4a775] mb-4">The Aaranya philosophy</p><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-tight">A little more meaning in what we wear.</h2><p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm leading-7 text-white/65 mt-6">Aaranya means forest: a reminder that the most beautiful things grow with care. We bring the hands and heritage behind Indian craft into pieces designed for how we live today.</p><a href="#shop" class="inline-block mt-8 text-[10px] tracking-[.2em] border-b border-[#c4a775] pb-2">MEET YOUR NEXT HEIRLOOM</a></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="px-5 sm:px-8 py-10 border-t border-[var(--line)]"><div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between gap-6"><div><a href="#home" class="brand text-lg">AARANYA</a><p class="text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mt-2">Indian artistry, made for your story.</p></div><div class="flex gap-6 text-xs text-[var(--muted)]"><a href="#shop">Shop</a><a href="#story">Our story</a><a href="mailto:care@aaranya.example">Get in touch</a></div><p class="text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]">© 2025 Aaranya. Made with intention.</p></div></footer>

  <div id="drawerBackdrop" class="drawer-backdrop"></div>
  <aside id="cartDrawer" class="cart-drawer" aria-label="Shopping bag" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 border-b border-[var(--line)]"><div><p class="eyebrow gold mb-1">Your selection</p><h2 class="serif text-2xl">Shopping bag <span id="drawerCount" class="text-sm text-[var(--muted)]"></span></h2></div><button id="closeCart" class="text-2xl p-1" aria-label="Close cart">×</button></div><div id="cartItems" class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-5"></div><div class="p-5 border-t border-[var(--line)]"><div class="flex justify-between text-sm mb-2"><span>Subtotal</span><span id="cartSubtotal">₹0</span></div><p class="text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] mb-4">Shipping and taxes calculated at checkout.</p><button id="checkoutBtn" class="solid-btn w-full bg-[#292823] text-white py-3.5 text-[10px] tracking-[.18em] uppercase">Proceed to checkout</button><button id="continueShopping" class="w-full py-3 text-xs underline text-[var(--muted)]">Continue exploring</button></div></aside>

  <div id="productModal" class="modal-shell"><div class="modal-backdrop" data-close="productModal"></div><div class="modal-panel surface relative w-full max-w-5xl max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto shadow-2xl"><button class="absolute right-3 top-2 z-10 text-3xl" data-close="productModal" aria-label="Close product details">×</button><div id="productDetail"></div></div></div>
  <div id="sizeGuideModal" class="modal-shell"><div class="modal-backdrop" data-close="sizeGuideModal"></div><div class="modal-panel surface relative w-full max-w-lg p-6 sm:p-8"><button class="absolute right-4 top-3 text-2xl" data-close="sizeGuideModal">×</button><p class="eyebrow gold">Find your fit</p><h2 class="serif text-3xl mt-2 mb-4">Aaranya size guide</h2><p class="text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mb-5">Our pieces are designed for a comfortable, graceful fit. Measurements are in inches.</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-xs text-left"><thead><tr class="border-b border-[var(--line)]"><th class="py-3">Size</th><th>Bust</th><th>Waist</th><th>Hip</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-[var(--line)]"><td class="py-3">S</td><td>34</td><td>28</td><td>38</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-[var(--line)]"><td class="py-3">M</td><td>36</td><td>30</td><td>40</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-[var(--line)]"><td class="py-3">L</td><td>38</td><td>32</td><td>42</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3">XL</td><td>40</td><td>34</td><td>44</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mt-5">Between sizes? We recommend choosing the larger size for a relaxed fit.</p></div></div>
  <div id="lightbox" class="modal-shell"><div class="modal-backdrop" data-close="lightbox"></div><div class="modal-panel relative max-w-5xl w-full flex justify-center"><button class="absolute -top-10 right-0 text-white text-3xl" data-close="lightbox" aria-label="Close image">×</button><button id="lightboxPrev" class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 text-white text-3xl px-3" aria-label="Previous image">‹</button><img id="lightboxImage" class="max-h-[85vh] max-w-full object-contain" alt="Product enlarged"><button id="lightboxNext" class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 text-white text-3xl px-3" aria-label="Next image">›</button></div></div>
  <div id="checkoutModal" class="modal-shell"><div class="modal-backdrop" data-close="checkoutModal"></div><div class="modal-panel surface relative w-full max-w-3xl max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl"><button class="absolute right-4 top-3 text-2xl" data-close="checkoutModal">×</button><div id="checkoutContent"></div></div></div>
  <div id="toast" class="toast bg-[#292823] text-white px-5 py-3 text-xs shadow-lg"></div>

  <script>
